<title>JAPAN: Kimuratan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kimuratan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.43		vs	    6.96</p>
<p> Operating   loss 966    mln	  vs   loss 427    mln</p>
<p> Current     loss 660    mln	  vs   loss 263    mln</p>
<p> Net	   loss 679    mln	  vs   loss 512    mln</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 17.90 yen	  vs    loss 13.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     38 million	  vs	  38 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 1.00 yen	  vs	    1.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kimuratan Corp is a manufacturer-wholesaler of infant wear.</p>
</text>
